{"id":"n66370-2-7","stage":1,"title":"사고 · 事故","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n66370-2-7-1","ko":"무슨 사고를 쳤길래 또 벌을 서는 거야?","zh":"你又闯什么祸了，怎么又在罚站？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"무슨","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무슨：什么","readings":[{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66237","senseId":"3","lemma":"무슨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사고를","meaning":"事故","explanation":"사고：事故；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"사고","audio":"/audio/2b04ea5b795422b77c61.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66370","senseId":"2","lemma":"사고","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"쳤길래","meaning":"搞，干","explanation":"치다：搞，干；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；길래：说明说话人据以采取行动的原因或发现。","readings":[{"term":"치다","audio":"/audio/5f8f6895b9ea6a978677.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57323","senseId":"22","lemma":"치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"또","meaning":"又","explanation":"또：又","readings":[{"term":"또","audio":"/audio/c7c5916d2df73410dd21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"51887","senseId":"1","lemma":"또","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"벌을","meaning":"惩罚，罚","explanation":"벌：惩罚，罚；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"벌","audio":"/audio/e96cb3184b4bef0751d0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14450","senseId":"1","lemma":"벌","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"서는","meaning":"排，站","explanation":"서다：排，站；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"서다","audio":"/audio/4fccaaf883d3c239af91.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68756","senseId":"19","lemma":"서다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거야?","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"41abb599007a8f8a","term":"무슨","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3","entryId":"66237","definition":"用于强调预料之外的、不合理的事情。","pronunciation":["무슨"]},{"id":"2b04ea5b795422b7","term":"사고","zh":"事故","audio":"/audio/2b04ea5b795422b77c61.mp3","entryId":"66370","definition":"给别人带来损害或问题的坏事。","pronunciation":["사ː고"]},{"id":"5f8f6895b9ea6a97","term":"치다","zh":"搞，干","audio":"/audio/5f8f6895b9ea6a978677.mp3","entryId":"57323","definition":"欺骗或折磨别人，或指做不好的举动。","pronunciation":["치다"]},{"id":"c7c5916d2df73410","term":"또","zh":"又","audio":"/audio/c7c5916d2df73410dd21.mp3","entryId":"51887","definition":"某件事情或行为再次发生。","pronunciation":["또"]},{"id":"e96cb3184b4bef07","term":"벌","zh":"惩罚，罚","audio":"/audio/e96cb3184b4bef0751d0.mp3","entryId":"14450","definition":"作为犯错或犯罪的代价而遭受的痛苦。","pronunciation":["벌"]},{"id":"4fccaaf883d3c239","term":"서다","zh":"排，站","audio":"/audio/4fccaaf883d3c239af91.mp3","entryId":"68756","definition":"列队。","pronunciation":["서다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/3d8b1bc0a79b7ecdb54d.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n66370-2-7-2","ko":"야구를 하다가 유리창을 깼어요.","zh":"打棒球时打破玻璃窗了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"야구를","meaning":"棒球","explanation":"야구：棒球；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"야구","audio":"/audio/7403c43735a4108cd9f2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62512","senseId":"1","lemma":"야구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하다가","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；다가：表示原有动作或状态中途转为另一情况。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"유리창을","meaning":"玻璃窗","explanation":"유리창：玻璃窗；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"유리창","audio":"/audio/5678a5702e7656e22155.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70467","senseId":"1","lemma":"유리창","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"깼어요.","meaning":"打碎，砸，毁","explanation":"깨다：打碎，砸，毁；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"깨다","audio":"/audio/f06d1a21bd6ecee5f09d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63406","senseId":"1","lemma":"깨다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"7403c43735a4108c","term":"야구","zh":"棒球","audio":"/audio/7403c43735a4108cd9f2.mp3","entryId":"62512","definition":"各由九名队员组成的两队轮流攻守，用棍子击打对方选手投出的球并绕竞技场一周即可得分的比赛。","pronunciation":["야ː구"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"5678a5702e7656e2","term":"유리창","zh":"玻璃窗","audio":"/audio/5678a5702e7656e22155.mp3","entryId":"70467","definition":"用玻璃做的窗。","pronunciation":["유리창"]},{"id":"f06d1a21bd6ecee5","term":"깨다","zh":"打碎，砸，毁","audio":"/audio/f06d1a21bd6ecee5f09d.mp3","entryId":"63406","definition":"打击坚硬的物体，使之成为碎片。","pronunciation":["깨다"]}],"audio":"/audio/00774b1d2cc3bfe57eff.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.307,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=66370","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"초급","day":33,"sequenceScore":1.5987,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["打棒球时打破玻璃窗了。","肚子很疼吗？","你又闯什么祸了，怎么又在罚站？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["打棒球时打破玻璃窗了。","你又闯什么祸了，怎么又在罚站？","肚子很疼吗？"],"answer":0}]}
